{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isEmoji"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property is true for scalars that are rendered as emoji by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also for scalars that have a non-default emoji rendering when followed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by U+FE0F VARIATION SELECTOR-16. This includes some scalars that are not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typically considered to be emoji:"}]},{"code":["let scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = [\"😎\", \"$\", \"0\"]","for s in scalars {","    print(s, \"-->\", s.properties.isEmoji)","}","\/\/ 😎 --> true","\/\/ $ --> false","\/\/ 0 --> true"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The final result is true because the ASCII digits have non-default emoji"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentations; some platforms render these with an alternate appearance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because of this behavior, testing ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji"},{"text":" alone on a single scalar is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insufficient to determine if a unit of text is rendered as an emoji; a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"correct test requires inspecting multiple scalars in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Character","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". In","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"addition to checking whether the base scalar has ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji == true"},{"text":", you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"must also check its default presentation (see "},{"code":"isEmojiPresentation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"determine whether it is followed by a variation selector that would modify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property corresponds to the “Emoji” property in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"http:\/\/www.unicode.org\/versions\/latest\/"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/Properties-swift.struct"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the scalar has an emoji"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation, whether or not it is the default."}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"10.10","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedA